122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (The future is scary. Thinking about the future is even scarier. When tasked with creating a future-based interactive project, I wanted to create an organic way to spark conversations about the future. As a designer and artist, I was drawn to the freedom of expression that creativity allows, so I decided to create a project that would invite people to share their own vision of the future.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
123 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (Draw Your Future is an interactive drawing project that invites users to imagine and illustrate what the future might look like. The project is designed as a playful but reflective creative tool, combining drawing, prompts, and a gallery upload system so people can share their ideas with others, making future thinking feel accessible, personal, and non-intimidating.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
