<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (Working on Draw Your Future taught me how powerful simple, open-ended creative tools can be when they are paired with clear structure. I learned that users are more willing to engage with a project when the interface feels approachable, the prompts are understandable, and the experience leaves room for personal interpretation.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
191 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (What I am most proud of is how the project turned into both a playful drawing space and a thoughtful reflection on the future. The most challenging part was making the tools and navigation intuitive while still keeping the project visually engaging, but that challenge was also the most rewarding part because it helped me refine the experience into something more polished and user-friendly.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
