/Title (In version 2, I resolved a lot of the visual details of the drawing interface, and added in the prompting section. Separating the tools from the form with the canvas in the center was the biggest improvement at this stage; it made the interface more organized and separated the creative process from the data input. The layout helps reduce cognitive load because users do not have to hunt around the page to understand where actions happen.This was the version I submitted for usability testing.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 358 0 R
>>
